  "title": "Portal Gun in Outer Wilds",
  "tagline": "Take Portal 2's portal gun into Outer Wilds' solar system and shoot portals across the planets.",
  "description": "Carry Portal 2's portal gun through Outer Wilds. Press 5 to take it out and fire blue and orange portals onto the planets, ships and ruins of the solar system, then step through them. The gun's model, textures and sounds are converted once from your own copy of Portal 2. Only Outer Wilds runs: Portal 2 is read, never started or changed.",
